messages.content:
Below is a minimal two-file setup.

index.html:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><title>Demo</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"/></head>
<body><main class="wrap"><h1>Welcome</h1><p class="sub">Short value prop.</p><a class="cta" href="#">Get started</a></main></body></html>
```

styles.css:
```css
body{margin:0;background:#0b1220;color:#e2e8f0;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;}
.wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:4rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;}
h1{font-size:2.25rem;margin:0 0 1rem;}
.sub{opacity:0.85;margin:0 0 2rem;}
.cta{display:inline-block;padding:0.75rem 1.25rem;border-radius:8px;background:#38bdf8;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;}
```
